meta {
  name: 03_RemoveAltinn2Role
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Scenario: Only Altinn 2 roles can be removed through the roles endpoint

    When the delegator removes an Altinn 2 role the receiver does not hold
    Then the request succeeds without changing anything
    And removing an Altinn 3 role such as rightholder is rejected
    And an unknown role code is rejected
    And an outsider cannot remove roles on the delegator's behalf

  Altinn 2 role assignments reach Altinn 3 only through the Altinn 2 role import, so the
  smoke test cannot create one to remove, and removing an imported one would destroy
  fixture data other suites depend on. The scenario therefore covers the no-op removal
  and the rejections, and leaves no state behind.
}
